### Get all students
GET http://localhost:4004/wardens
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###
GET http://localhost:4004/wardens/de1e1df0-96f4-4ad8-93d8-323928c1340c
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###

